    <p class="lead">
      I studied Media Sciences in Kolkata and moved to Poland in 2023 for a master’s in Media and Communication
      Management at Uniwersytet Wrocławski.
    </p>
    <p>
      My work so far covers three fields. In digital marketing I managed an influencer partnership and paid campaigns
      for Wow Momo Foods, and later produced weekly short-form content for an education consultancy. In customer
      service I worked the counter and drive-thru at McDonald’s and trained new colleagues. In logistics I inspect
      inbound goods and check shipment documents.
    </p>
    <p>What connects them is clear communication and attention to detail.</p>
